From: Philip John Basile <PBasile@Basilecom.com>
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(mtp): report target logprobs for accepted drafts

An accepted speculative token is an output of the target distribution. Return
the verifier/target log-probability vector rather than the MTP draft-head
vector.

This patch is scoped to AirRunner/mlx-lm feat/mtp-native at
`e8ceeccf118d4a089e22431f28f89d5ffe7d9d2b`.

Source: ml-explore/mlx-lm#1740,
PhilipJohnBasile/mlx-lm@bc1d11414c12372cdf76538e09ce1fbc54b7fc7b

Signed-off-by: Philip John Basile <PBasile@Basilecom.com>
---
 mlx_lm/generate.py | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/mlx_lm/generate.py b/mlx_lm/generate.py
--- a/mlx_lm/generate.py
+++ b/mlx_lm/generate.py
@@ -905,7 +905,7 @@ def mtp_generate_step(
             if accept:
                 _clear_rollback()
                 ntoks += 1
-                yield draft_tok_id, draft_lp, True
+                yield draft_tok_id, verify_lp, True
                 if ntoks >= max_tokens:
                     return
                 ntoks += 1
-- 
2.50.1
